  "description": "Promised to the user in TASK-3.4 Q-4. Until all-ins exist the engine refuses stacks below 8 small bets + 8 big bets ($96 at $4/$8), so TASK-3.4's nextHand tops up any seat below that minimum to the $160 buy-in. The code carries the comment 'TEMPORARY (TASK-3.4 Q-4)'. This temporarily bends REQ-007.4 (no chips added above $0). This task depends on TASK-1.9 (all-in calls), TASK-1.16 (button past busted seats) and TASK-3.11 (Rebuy/Leave), so it becomes ready only when short stacks can really be played.",
